#. UI string “wfNote”
msgid "wfNote"
msgstr ""
"<b>Events</b> mode learns and subtracts the steady noise floor, leaving only "
"genuine impulses; a sferic is a vertical line. The <b>J hunt</b> button "
"shortens the analysis window and speeds up the scroll: since a tweek lasts "
"50–100 ms, only at this setting does its tail spread out horizontally and "
"reveal the <b>J</b> hook near 1.7 kHz. Tweeks occur only at night."

