#. UI string guide0_t
msgid "guide0_t"
msgstr "Sferic"

#. UI string guide0_s
msgid "guide0_s"
msgstr "Short click / crackle"

#. UI string guide0_d
msgid "guide0_d"
msgstr ""
"The radio pulse of a single lightning discharge, often thousands of km away. "
"The most common natural signal; a thin vertical line on the waterfall."

#. UI string guide1_t
msgid "guide1_t"
msgstr "Tweek"

#. UI string guide1_s
msgid "guide1_s"
msgstr "Metallic chirp"

#. UI string guide1_d
msgid "guide1_d"
msgstr ""
"A sferic that bounced inside the Earth–ionosphere waveguide. Low frequencies "
"arrive late, giving it a tail — the \"J\" hook near 1.7 kHz. Night only."

#. UI string guide2_t
msgid "guide2_t"
msgstr "Whistler"

#. UI string guide2_s
msgid "guide2_s"
msgstr "Long descending whistle"

#. UI string guide2_d
msgid "guide2_d"
msgstr ""
"Lightning energy that travelled along magnetic field lines through the "
"magnetosphere and came back. Seconds long, gliding from high to low. Rare."

#. UI string guide3_t
msgid "guide3_t"
msgstr "Dawn chorus"

#. UI string guide3_s
msgid "guide3_s"
msgstr "Like birdsong"

#. UI string guide3_d
msgid "guide3_d"
msgstr ""
"A chorus generated by electrons in the magnetosphere, strongest near dawn "
"and at higher latitudes."

#. UI string guide4_t
msgid "guide4_t"
msgstr "Mains hum"

#. UI string guide4_s
msgid "guide4_s"
msgstr "Thick continuous buzz"

#. UI string guide4_d
msgid "guide4_d"
msgstr ""
"50 Hz and its harmonics — not natural, just the building's wiring. "
"Suppressed on the Clean channel, audible on Raw."

#. UI string guide5_t
msgid "guide5_t"
msgstr "Switching noise"

#. UI string guide5_s
msgid "guide5_s"
msgstr "Harsh steady tones"

#. UI string guide5_d
msgid "guide5_d"
msgstr ""
"Phone chargers, LED drivers, monitors. Motionless horizontal lines on the "
"waterfall. The reference probe learns these and subtracts them."

